  "notes": [
    "2026-08-25: check 4's gate moved from `pathStem(filepath).includes(\"slides\")` to `isTypDeck` (a slides/presentation* PATH COMPONENT, or a touying/polylux/#slide( marker). The old stem test matched only a file literally named slides.typ, so every deck stored as slides/<name>.typ — the teaching convention — skipped the check silently. The qr case's fixture moved to slides/01-intro.typ accordingly; a bare slides.typ carrying no deck marker is no longer a deck."
  ]
